## 🗃️ Data Models

### Admin — `src/models/admin.js`

| Field | Type | Rules |
|---|---|---|
| `name` | String | Required, trimmed |
| `email` | String | Required · unique · lowercased |
| `passwordHash` | String | Required — Argon2id hash; legacy bcrypt hashes are upgraded on login |
| `createdAt` / `updatedAt` | Date | Automatic |

### Blog — `src/models/blog.js`

| Field | Type | Rules |
|---|---|---|
| `title` | String | Required · 3–200 |
| `slug` | String | Required · unique · URL-safe · auto-generated, editable |
| `excerpt` | String | Required · 10–500 |
| `content` | String | Required · HTML · sanitized pre-storage |
| `featuredImage` | Object | `{ url (required), publicId, alt }` |
| `category` | String | Required |
| `author` | String | Required |
| `status` | String | `draft` \| `published` — default `draft` |
| `publishedAt` | Date | Set on first publish · `null` for drafts |
| `seoTitle` / `seoDescription` | String | Optional |
| `createdAt` / `updatedAt` | Date | Automatic |

**Indexes:** Unique slug · `{ status: 1, publishedAt: -1 }` (public listing) · category (filtering).

### Contact — Planned (M4)

📋 **Planned schema — not yet implemented.**

---

## 🔐 Security

| Control | Implementation |
|---|---|
| 🔑 Passwords | Argon2id · legacy bcrypt hashes upgraded on login · generic login errors · no public sign-up (CLI only) |
| 🎫 Sessions | 2h signed JWT · HttpOnly · SameSite=Lax · Secure in production |
| 🛡️ CSRF | SameSite cookie + `originCheck` middleware (non-allowlisted origins → 403 on state changes) |
| 🚪 Authorization | `requireAdmin` verifies JWT and loads the admin from DB on every protected route |
| 🧼 XSS | `sanitize-html` strips scripts/event handlers from article content before storage |
| ✅ Input | Every body/query validated; malformed JSON → clean `400 INVALID_JSON` |
| 🖼️ Uploads | MIME whitelist · 5 MB cap · Cloudinary-generated safe identifiers |
| 🚫 Errors | Centralized handler — no stack traces, secrets or DB internals to clients |
| 🚦 Rate limits | Login: 10 / 15 min |

---

## 🧪 Testing

Manual suite (Thunder Client) mapped to brief §11.1:

- ✅ Valid login sets cookie; `/me` returns profile.
- ✅ Wrong password → `401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS` (generic).
- ✅ Admin endpoints without cookie → `401 UNAUTHENTICATED`.
- ✅ Malformed JSON body → `400 INVALID_JSON` (no HTML/stack trace).
- ✅ Create published article → appears in public list + slug detail.
- ⬜ Unpublish → article vanishes from public endpoints.
- ⬜ Republish → reappears.
- ⬜ Duplicate title → slug `-2` suffix.
- ⬜ Validation failure → `400` with fields map.
- ⬜ Delete → removed from admin + public.
- ⬜ Image upload → Cloudinary URL (endpoint implemented; Thunder free tier blocks file uploads — test via `curl -F` or Postman).

📸 Evidence screenshots are attached to the PR.

