## 🗺️ Roadmap

### Next — M4 (Contact & Dashboard)

- Contact model + public `POST /api/contact` (validated, rate-limited, no auth).
- Admin enquiry management — list / detail / status (`new` → `read` → `resolved`) / delete.
- `GET /api/admin/dashboard/summary` — article + enquiry counts, 5 recent enquiries.

### Then — M5 (Admin UI & Integration)

- Next.js `/admin` routes: login · dashboard · blogs list/new/edit · contacts list/detail · sidebar + logout.
- End-to-end integration with the public blog/contact frontend owner.

### Open Questions for Team Lead (Brief §13)

- Public blog route `/blogs` vs `/insights`.
- Contact subject field.
- Upload Brief attachment.
- Cloudinary account ownership.
- Admin credential provisioning.
- API/DB hosting.

