## 🌿 Git Workflow

```text
staging ──← feature/backend-admin-system (PRs only)
```

- Branch from latest `staging` → PR into `staging`.
- ❌ Never push directly to `main`.
- ❌ Never commit `.env` or rewrite another developer's pages.

